// Title: Renamed CreateDump Utility Execution
// ID: 1a1ed54a-2ba4-4221-94d5-01dee560d71e
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-20
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects uses of a renamed legitimate createdump.exe LOLOBIN utility to dump process memory
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((((process.command_line like "*_ -u *" and process.command_line like "*_ -f *" and process.command_line like "*_.dmp*")) or ((process.command_line like "*_ --full *" and process.command_line like "*_ --name *" and process.command_line like "*_.dmp*"))) or (process.pe.original_file_name == "FX_VER_INTERNALNAME_STR")) and not ((process.executable endswith "\\createdump.exe")))
